Wed Sep  2 07:38:04 UTC 2026 - Jan Engelhardt <jengelh@inai.de>

- Update to release 1.7.1
  * In `SplitExtensionCHR`, `NonsplitExtension` and
    `CoveringGroup`, the order of the result is now known if the
    order of the given finitely presented group is known.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sat Aug 15 02:14:44 UTC 2026 - Jan Engelhardt <jengelh@inai.de>

- Update to release 1.7.0
  * Report an error when an external program fails, instead of
    returning the result of an earlier stage of the computation
  * Raise the space `nqrun` reserves for relations tenfold
  * Replace the recursive build system by a single Makefile, with
    new `standalone`, `doc` and `check` targets
  * Fix the type mismatches between the C files, and make the
    standalone-only programs compile again

